  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220000040 Solidaridad - Pathways to Prosperity 4000006180-DDE deel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220000040 (4000006180 DDE deel) Pathways to prosperity will scale the uptake of sustainable, inclusive production/trade practices and food security in multiple countries and in selected sectors. Connecting producers, service providers, financial institutions, buyers and governments. Activities follow four pathways to achieve this: 1. support producers to gain essential knowledge and entrepreneurial skills; 2. create fair and inclusive access to services and technology; 3. support access to inclusive finance; 4. connect producers to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
